{"sections":[{"slug":"相变","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"相变"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">相变</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“相变”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">物理系统的相变是指物理量相对于某些参数的非连续变化</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span> Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">量变化时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">其最小特征值的特征向量</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">基态</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">会发生非连续变化</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">相变有时是指</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/能隙","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">能隙</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的关闭和打开</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相变与对称性破缺</span></h2>\n<p>Ginzburg–Landau <span lang=\"zh\">曾猜想所有相变均由对称性的破缺刻画</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">然而拓扑序给出了反例</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $2$ <span lang=\"zh\">维</span> Ising <span lang=\"zh\">模型</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $\\bigotimes \\mathbb{C}^2$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">量</span> $H=- J\\sum_{i,j\\text{相邻}}\\sigma_i^Z\\sigma_j^Z-h\\sum\\sigma_i^X$ (<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\sigma^X,\\sigma^Z$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Pauli矩阵","text":"Pauli <span lang=\"zh\">矩阵</span>"}},{"Plain":"). <span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $h\\gg J$ (<span lang=\"zh\">所谓</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">高能</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">极限</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $J$ <span lang=\"zh\">与温度成反比</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">时</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">基态接近于</span>\n$$\r\n\\cdots\\otimes\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\otimes \\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\otimes\\cdots,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">而当</span> $J\\gg h$ (“<span lang=\"zh\">低能</span>”) <span lang=\"zh\">时基态接近于</span>\n$$\r\n\\cdots\\otimes\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\otimes \\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\\otimes\\cdots,\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\cdots\\otimes\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\otimes \\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\otimes\\cdots.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑序</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拓扑序","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拓扑序</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是指</span></p>\n"}]}}}]}